 7 ROLES IN DEVOPS + KEY TECHNOLOGIES :
----------------------------------------------------

🔹 DevOps Engineer – Automation Backbone

Technologies: GitHub/GitLab, Jenkins, Docker, Kubernetes, Terraform, Ansible, Slack (alerts).

🔹 Platform Engineer – Developer Productivity Builder

Technologies: Kubernetes, Helm, CI/CD templates, AWS (EC2, ALB, Auto Scaling), CloudWatch, S3.

🔹 Cloud Engineer – Infrastructure Architect

Technologies: AWS (VPC, EC2, ALB, IAM), Azure, GCP, Auto Scaling, CloudWatch, S3, networking tools.

🔹 Release Engineer – Deployment Strategist

Technologies: Git (release tags), Blue‑Green & Canary deployments, Jenkins, ArgoCD, Spinnaker, monitoring tools (Prometheus, Grafana).

🔹 DevSecOps Engineer – Security Automation Expert

Technologies: SAST/DAST scanners (SonarQube, OWASP ZAP), CVE detection tools, HashiCorp Vault, Aqua Security, Trivy, CloudWatch alerts.

🔹 Site Reliability Engineer (SRE) – Uptime Guardian

Technologies: Kubernetes (auto‑scaling), Prometheus, Grafana, ELK stack, PagerDuty, incident management tools, SLA/SLO tracking.

🔹 Automation Engineer – Release Enabler

Technologies: Jenkins, GitHub Actions, Ansible, Terraform, CI/CD pipelines, container orchestration (Docker, Kubernetes).
